 458:     F3's sentence "the model's `irq_base` stays write-only" was FALSE globally -- `dev_footbridge.c:432` reads it -- and is
 459:     corrected to "never read by dev_8259.c or dev_gt.c" (L4).
 460: A2  F13/D5 (Astra OVERTURN, GLM B REFINE "rowable as band, declined on cost", Grok REFINE with the catch-up-loop reason, GLM A
 461:     and DeepSeek B UPHOLD): F13 MIS-ATTRIBUTED GLM's pass-2 position -- it had asked for a banded mixed-source retirement row,
 462:     not concluded "no row exists" (L4, corrected here and in the records).  The disposition becomes: no DETERMINISTIC row
